   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Outbox 1 of 4: changing a database AND telling Kafka, as two separate steps,\ncan never be made safe by clever ordering or retries alone",
   "originalText": "Outbox 1 of 4: changing a database AND telling Kafka, as two separate steps,\ncan never be made safe by clever ordering or retries alone",
