   "text": "Dual writes are a CODE-STRUCTURE hazard: every place that does \"write state, then announce\" re-opens the window.",
   "originalText": "Dual writes are a CODE-STRUCTURE hazard: every place that does \"write state, then announce\" re-opens the window.",
