   "text": "In ORDER B the event was already published before that COMMIT, so a \"failed\" write may really be committed, or the event may really be a\nphantom. You cannot know from the error.",
   "originalText": "In ORDER B the event was already published before that COMMIT, so a \"failed\" write may really be committed, or the event may really be a\nphantom. You cannot know from the error.",
