   "text": "2PC (XA/JTA in Java): a coordinator makes several resource managers commit atomically, by \"prepare\", then \"commit\".",
   "originalText": "2PC (XA/JTA in Java): a coordinator makes several resource managers commit atomically, by \"prepare\", then \"commit\".",
