   "text": "(a) The consumer can read the event before COMMIT and not find the data.\n(b) If COMMIT fails or rolls back after the send, the event is a phantom. A\nsend timeout may also hide a successful publish.",
   "originalText": "(a) The consumer can read the event before COMMIT and not find the data.\n(b) If COMMIT fails or rolls back after the send, the event is a phantom. A\nsend timeout may also hide a successful publish.",
